  m_text: "<size=118%><b><color=#8AB4F8>Viewing a module</color></b></size>\n<alpha=#CC>Once
    a module opens, hold your phone up like you're taking a photo. The 3D visualization
    appears in front of the camera on its own and gently follows as you move \u2014
    there's nothing to scan and no marker to find. If it looks small or off to one
    side, just turn or step to recentre it in view."
