  m_text: '<align=left><alpha=#FF><size=118%><b><color=#8AB4F8>About the Application</color></b></size>

    <size=45%>

    </size><align=justified><alpha=#CC>MART_PROG
    is an educational application designed to help students learn core programming
    and data structure concepts through interactive augmented reality (AR) experiences.

    <size=70%>

    </size><align=left><alpha=#FF><size=118%><b><color=#8AB4F8>Research
    Study</color></b></size>

    <size=45%>

    </size><align=justified><alpha=#CC>This
    application is part of a research study comparing augmented reality-based learning
    with a traditional approach to learning introductory programming and data structures.'
