  m_text: "<size=118%><b><color=#8AB4F8>Using the controls</color></b></size>\n<alpha=#CC>Below
    the camera view, a row of buttons performs that module's actions \u2014 their
    names change per module (for example Push/Pop, Enqueue/Dequeue, or Insert/Delete).
    Where a value is needed, type it in the box above the buttons first. Cards further
    down the screen update after every action to show what happened."
