  m_text: "<align=left><alpha=#FF><size=118%><b><color=#8AB4F8>What You Will Learn</color></b></size>\n<size=45%>\n</size><align=justified><alpha=#CC>The
    application covers the following topics:\n<size=45%>\n</size><align=left><margin-left=1.2em><alpha=#CC>\u2022
    Arrays and Lists\n\u2022 Stacks\n\u2022 Queues\n\u2022 Linked Lists\n\u2022 Functions\n\u2022
    Loops\n\u2022 Selection\n\u2022 Memory Management\n<size=70%>\n</size><margin-left=0><align=justified>Each
    module allows you to perform interactive operations on a 3D representation of
    the concept in your own physical environment. Step-by-step explanations and short
    quizzes are provided to support your learning."
